    "targetModeRule": "ENEMY_UNIT_TARGET: max range > 0 and some effect's targeting_1 is T_UNIT_TARGET_ENEMY. ENEMY_TARGET_DESTINATION: max range > 0, no effect targets T_UNIT_TARGET_ENEMY, and some effect's targeting_1 is T_DESTINATION_TARGET_ENEMY. UNTARGETED: anything else (a cone, a caster-centred area, max range 0).",
